8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to see what actually breaks our trust.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I need the real numbers, not guesses, before we decide.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
