35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The car is often dirty and low on fuel when I get it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,The diary shows Saturday is three times busier than Tuesday.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen, and heavy weeks are brutal.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Other groups failed because asking for favours felt like a burden.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Two people bought most of the fuel, and short runs hurt the car.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
