42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, yes, the bursts of use make the sharing unstable.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, I agree, the favour-asking is what sours the relationship.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, the fuel split is lopsided, which feels unfair.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I need a system where the car is ready without asking.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,I need to stop spending hours calculating who owes what.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,I need a fair split that accounts for the heavy weeks.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I need to avoid the resentment that comes from constant requests.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I need to see who is actually driving the most.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
